  "id": "linux-nvidia-dgx-spark-2x-qwen38-flash-next-atlas",
  "name": "2x DGX Spark Qwen3.8 Flash Next FP4-Local Atlas (SparkQwen 0.5.1)",
  "version": 5,
  "summary": "Two directly connected Sparks running SparkQwen 0.5.1 on the Atlas engine over the private fabric, serving nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local with its built-in MTP head: up to eight requests of up to 262144 tokens from one shared BF16 KV pool, in Spark mode. Two modes: dedicated (the pair serves Qwen alone) and sidecars (leaves memory for services such as embedding or image generation on the same Sparks). Additive only: no default model, no aliases.",
  "description": "This recipe installs SparkQwen 0.5.1 at the immutable product revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkqwen/pins-0.5.1.json. LLooM owns orchestration, admission, worker-first startup, readiness, routing and telemetry. The Atlas engine image is built from Enntity/sparkqwen by that repository's install/build.sh and published to GHCR; LLooM commits no engine source. The engine (Atlas-Inf/atlas plus Enntity's open Atlas-Inf PRs, on the Enntity/atlas spark branch) is AGPL-3.0-only and runs from its own container image. Setup acquires the pinned checkpoint, pulls the pinned image by its immutable manifest digest (the mutable tag is never pulled), and verifies the image's arm64 architecture, io.enntity.sparkqwen.install-tree contents label and in-image contract. The checkpoint is served as published: no overlay conversion and no separate drafter (speculation uses the checkpoint's own MTP head). Tools and reasoning are qualified by SparkQwen; structured output is implemented by the engine but untested with this model; image and short-video input are qualified by SparkQwen.",
  "license": {
    "id": "MIT",
    "name": "Recipe metadata, launcher and orchestration"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "lloom",
    "generatedBy": "manual-curated",
    "source": "SparkQwen 0.5.1: Enntity/sparkqwen 2e95e17b2f2e12fd10fce454ff5adbb32ce5ae91 (tag v0.5.1, install tree 01e43f5c2eb2d1d2ff35d8e9e4632c2848b00e90), engine Enntity/atlas spark @ 5f79b46ba7b0e8b14f8b2966cca9e2546f18560d (Atlas-Inf main 2f9c37083, which carries Enntity's Atlas-Inf PRs #321, #322 and #323 and the maintainers' #319 and #320; AGPL-3.0-only, recorded in the image's /opt/atlas/source-manifest.json). The image is ghcr.io/enntity/atlas-sparkqwen:01e43f5c2eb2 (also :0.5.1), addressed by its GHCR manifest digest in pins-0.5.1.json. The engine argument vectors ship inside the image as /opt/atlas/profiles/*.json and are selected with SPARKQWEN_PROFILE: 8x262k (dedicated: eight sequences of up to 262144 tokens, BF16 KV, 0.88 GPU memory utilization) and saver-8x262k (sidecars: the same slots at 0.74, with the display carveout). Model nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local revision b9ce18a6887e18c089fdea8509a33e63429a3300."
  },
